          %h3#InSimplicialModelCategoryTheory For simplicial presheaves on plain categories
          %p
            We discuss generalizations of the above situation from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/presheaves"} presheaves
            to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+presheaves"} simplicial presheaves
          %h4#SimplicialPresheavesOverZeroTruncatedObjects Over 0-truncated objects
          %p For
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
