          #SimplicialLocalSectionsIsRightQuillen.num_prop
            %h6 Proposition
            %p
              Relative to these projective (slice) model structures, the comparison functor from Exp.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ForSimplicialPresheaves"}
              is a
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+Quillen+functor"} right Quillen functor
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+adjoint"} right adjoint
              in a
